{"comment_text": {"ja28:0.1": "", "ja28:0.2": "", "ja28:0.3": "", "ja28:0.4": "", "ja28:1.1": "A brahmin wagers that his ox, Nandivisāla, can pull a hundred carts. When yelled at, the beast refuses to pull, but when spoken to kindly he pulls the load and wins the bet. | This is the origin story for <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc2/en/sujato'>Bu Pc 2</a>, where the verse has some different readings. ", "ja28:1.2": "", "ja28:1.3": "", "ja28:1.4": "", "ja28:1.5": "", "ja28:1.6": "", "ja28:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja28:0.1": "<article id='ja28'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja28:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja28:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja28:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja28:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja28:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja28:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja28:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja28:1.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja28:1.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja28:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja28:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja28:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja28:0.3": "Kuruṅgavagga ", "ja28:0.4": "8. Nandivisālajātaka ", "ja28:1.1": "“Manuññameva bhāseyya, ", "ja28:1.2": "nāmanuññaṁ kudācanaṁ; ", "ja28:1.3": "Manuññaṁ bhāsamānassa, ", "ja28:1.4": "garuṁ bhāraṁ udaddhari; ", "ja28:1.5": "Dhanañca naṁ alābhesi, ", "ja28:1.6": "tena cattamano ahū”ti. ", "ja28:2.1": "Nandivisālajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja28:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 28 ", "ja28:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja28:0.3": "The Four-horned Antelope ", "ja28:0.4": "The Ox Named Nandivisāla: a past life story ", "ja28:1.1": "One should only speak sweetly, ", "ja28:1.2": "never not sweetly. ", "ja28:1.3": "For the one speaking sweetly, ", "ja28:1.4": "a large load was pulled, ", "ja28:1.5": "earning him money, ", "ja28:1.6": "and he was satisfied with that. ", "ja28:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja28:0.1": "", "ja28:0.2": "", "ja28:0.3": "", "ja28:0.4": "", "ja28:1.1": "dr27.11, ms22J_60, msdiv28, ndp22.9, pts-vp-pli1.193, sya27.10", "ja28:1.2": "", "ja28:1.3": "", "ja28:1.4": "", "ja28:1.5": "", "ja28:1.6": "", "ja28:2.1": "ms22J_61"}, "keys_order": ["ja28:0.1", "ja28:0.2", "ja28:0.3", "ja28:0.4", "ja28:1.1", "ja28:1.2", "ja28:1.3", "ja28:1.4", "ja28:1.5", "ja28:1.6", "ja28:2.1"]}